/**
 * Machine-readable reason of pair_error. Clients localize by reason, never by message text
 * (English, for logs only). invalid_request = pin/client_name missing, not strings or client_name
 * longer than 100 characters; invalid_client_info = malformed client info; pin_invalid = no active
 * PIN matches (wrong, already used or cancelled); pin_expired = the PIN matched but its 5-minute
