/**
 * Kind of a profile: what the devices of the profile are for. person = a member of the household
 * (adult, parent, easy mode); child = a child (independent of parental controls: a teen profile
 * without parental controls is still child); panel = wall panel; tv = Apple TV / Android TV; guest
 * = a guest (always a guest access with expiry); house_sitter = a house sitter or helper (guest
 * access with expiry, usually longer and remote); babysitter = a babysitter (guest access with
 * expiry, only at home, may answer the children's requests with the rule babysitter_requests). The
 * kind groups the profiles for “Set up new devices” (rule setup_devices) and decides which
 * profiles a member may give; it changes no rule by itself, except that some rules apply only to
 * some kinds (catalog profile_kinds: setup_devices only person, babysitter_requests only
