 * access_requests is on. enabled = the rule is on and the device has access hours; available = it
 * can ask right now: enabled, closed by the schedule (access.hours.reason schedule, switch on), no
 * own open request, limits not reached and someone can answer (recipients or an admin notification
 * rule for access_requested). The app shows the button on “Access again from …” only with
 * available; requests go only over the hub WebSocket (at home: away the device holds no valid Home
 * Assistant key while closed, the app says “Only possible at home”). The hub sends
 * client_config_updated when available, recipients or the open request change.
