 * ChaCha20Poly1305, sequence number 0. Case rfc9180-a.2.1-seq0 is the RFC test vector A.2.1 (first
 * encryption); case onboard-v1 uses info "hub/onboard/v1", aad = session id (ASCII) and the
 * plaintext JSON {client_id, secret}; case watch-access-v1 uses info "hub/watch-access/v1", aad =
 * client_id (ASCII) and a sealed watch access (crypto/watch-access-plaintext.json,
 * watch_access.sealed). tools/validate.py recomputes enc and ct from sk_e and checks that sk_r
 * opens ct; the hub and the apps (CryptoKit HPKE.Recipient) open every case.
