/**
 * Hub -> integration push session only. The device is gone (deleted, revoked, guest expired, all
 * clients cleared). The integration removes the device's HA user (HA removes its token and closes
 * its sessions). No acknowledgement: if the message is lost, the reconcile on the next status poll
 * removes every device user without an active client.
